query valid_will is:
    which person may make a will.

query which_may_make_a_will is:
    which person may make a will.

the view the act is:
    the title is "Wills Act, as Blawx encodes it".
    the case is a scenario, with the documents it is stated in.
    the facts about "the case" are
        a person is a person,
        a person is a number years of age,
        a person is an active military member.
    the result is the answer to query which_may_make_a_will.
    the result shows its reasons.
    the result shows its citations.
    the result can be flipped.

